{"id":"71b29ecf4e6d3eb0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md","title":"Algebraic Set","display":"df-algebraic-set — Algebraic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-set","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-set","Algebraic Set"],"display":"df-algebraic-set — Algebraic Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-polynomial]]","[[58-df-field]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-set</span><span>Algebraic Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-set — Algebraic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\in V\">\\(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal P(k^n)\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal P(k^n)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)\\)</span> (coefficient support defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\times k^n\\to k\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\times k^n\\to k\\)</span> (polynomial evaluation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\\to\\mathcal P(k^n)\">\\(V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\\to\\mathcal P(k^n)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k^n)\\to\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\">\\(I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k^n)\\to\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate with the designated field structure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)}f(\\alpha)\\cdot_k\\prod_{i&lt;n}x_i^{\\alpha(i)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)}f(\\alpha)\\cdot_k\\prod_{i&lt;n}x_i^{\\alpha(i)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus} \\vdash V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in k^n:\\forall f\\in F\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus} \\vdash V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in k^n:\\forall f\\in F\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}vanishing\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(S)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]:\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}vanishing\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(S)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]:\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(S;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land S\\subseteq k^n\\land\\exists F\\subseteq k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\;(S=V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(S;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land S\\subseteq k^n\\land\\exists F\\subseteq k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\;(S=V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Algebraic set: common zeros of polynomials; Zariski topology basis</li>\n<li>Nullstellensatz consequences belong in theorem files, not in this definition.</li>\n<li>Polynomial support is now a locally defined coefficient-support operator, so it cannot be confused with topological support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Commutative Algebra</li>\n<li>Shafarevich, Basic Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\in V$ (see [[58-df-polynomial]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal P(k^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}:k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\times k^n\\to k","display":false},{"tex":"V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])\\to\\mathcal P(k^n)","display":false},{"tex":"I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}:\\mathcal P(k^n)\\to\\mathcal P(k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}evaluation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{k,n}(f)}f(\\alpha)\\cdot_k\\prod_{i<n}x_i^{\\alpha(i)}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus} \\vdash V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in k^n:\\forall f\\in F\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}vanishing\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash I_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(S)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]:\\forall x\\in S\\;(\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}(f,x)=0_k)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(S;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land S\\subseteq k^n\\land\\exists F\\subseteq k[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\;(S=V_{k,n}^{+_k,\\cdot_k}(F))","display":true}],"bytes":2393,"backlinks":[{"id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ev}_{k,n}$ (polynomial evaluation for the designated field structure, see [[../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md]])"},{"id":"621e8d7c1c15f553","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlgSet}_{k,n}(X;+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (affine-algebraic-set predicate, see [[58-df-algebraic-set]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-algebraic-set]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-algebraic-set.md|58-df-algebraic-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}